    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1450070e-d429-38fb-a0ad-ff5d01d5c98d",
                "word": "pent",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "73233094-d045-3a85-83a0-3ece67e6c76b",
                        "entry_id": "1450070e-d429-38fb-a0ad-ff5d01d5c98d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Confined in, or as if in, a pen; imprisoned."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3cf3a415-7c7f-49e7-b409-be42b1343eec",
                                "sense_id": "73233094-d045-3a85-83a0-3ece67e6c76b",
                                "text": "As the old woman, with a gigantic and distorted image of herself thrown half upon the wall behind her, half upon the roof above, sat bending over the few loose bricks within which it was pent, on the damp hearth of the chimney—for there was no stove—she looked as if she were watching at some witch’s altar for a favourable token; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a1d0772-c988-4dc7-b5a5-7e2da4d8ab73",
                                "sense_id": "73233094-d045-3a85-83a0-3ece67e6c76b",
                                "text": "Wherever Miss Clavering went, this infatuated young fellow continued to follow her; and being aware that his engagement to his cousin was known in the world, he was forced to make a mystery of his passion, and confine it to his own breast, so that it was so pent in there and pressed down, that it is a wonder he did not explode some day with the stormy secret, and perish collapsed after the outburst."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db5be83f-33ab-48ba-8978-fb0652c0ecc1",
                                "sense_id": "73233094-d045-3a85-83a0-3ece67e6c76b",
                                "text": "My object all sublime\nI shall achieve in time —\nTo let the punishment fit the crime —\nThe punishment fit the crime;\nAnd make each prisoner pent\nUnwillingly represent\nA source of innocent merriment!\nOf innocent merriment!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "948c6331-c809-4ba0-b4e6-94799afce270",
                                "sense_id": "73233094-d045-3a85-83a0-3ece67e6c76b",
                                "text": "Numa, ravenous with hunger, had long since learned the futility of roaring and moaning as he searched for prey, but now that it was as surely his as though already he had felt the soft flesh beneath his still mighty paw, he opened his huge jaws, and gave vent to his long-pent rage in a series of deafening roars that made the air tremble."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
